<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Sept 14--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Sept 14--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---09/14/96  09/07/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		    12.0	18,800    16,784    28,576</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   5.8	 9,267     8,757    10,017</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  36.9	   942	 688     1,062</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  -0.2	17,977    18,015    21,942</p>
